
//- Full-screen branding panel for desktop layouts.
aside(
    class="relative hidden min-h-screen flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden bg-primary p-10 text-white lg:flex xl:p-14"
    aria-label="Información sobre SaludVital"
)
    div(class="relative z-10")
        //- Center the larger brand logo on desktop screens.
        img(
            class="mx-auto mb-12 h-28 w-auto  rounded-2xl border border-white object-contain shadow-lg"
            src="/brand/logo-primary-dark.png"
            alt="Logotipo de SaludVital"
            width="280"
            height="112"
            style=" border-radius: 15px;border: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); box-shadow: 0 0 10px 3px #0B3B78;"

        )

        //- Use a lighter teal to meet WCAG AA contrast requirements.
        p(class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#2DD4BF]") Tu salud, siempre conectada

        h2(class="max-w-md text-4xl font-bold leading-tight xl:text-5xl") Tu bienestar es nuestra prioridad.

        p(class="mt-6 max-w-md text-base leading-7 text-blue-100")
            | Gestiona tus citas médicas y mantente en contacto con tu equipo de salud desde un solo lugar.

    |

    //- Display professional healthcare platform benefits.
    div(class="relative z-10 mt-12 grid gap-4")
        //- Appointment management benefit.
        div(class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl  p-4 transition-colors hover:bg-white/10")
            div(class="flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl  text-teal")
                img(
                    src="brand/calendar-svgrepo-com.svg"
                    width="22"
                    height="22"
                    alt=""
                    aria-hidden="true"
                )

            div(class="min-w-0")
                p(class="font-semibold tracking-tight text-white") Gestión integral de citas médicas
                p(class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-blue-100/80") Organiza tus citas y consulta la información de tu atención médica de manera sencilla.

        //- Secure healthcare information benefit.
        //- Display the security icon from the public assets directory.
        div(class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl p-4 transition-colors hover:bg-white/10")
            div(class="flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-teal")
                img(
                    src="/brand/shield-svgrepo-com.svg"
                    width="22"
                    height="22"
                    alt=""
                    aria-hidden="true"
                )

            div(class="min-w-0")
                p(class="font-semibold tracking-tight text-white") Protección de tu información
                p(class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-blue-100/80") Tu privacidad y la seguridad de tus datos son fundamentales para SaludVital.

